@startuml
actor User
participant "My lessons screen" as Screen
participant "GetMyLessonsController" as Controller
participant "GetMyLessonsHandler" as Handler
database SQLServer
User -> Screen: Select page or view
Screen -> Controller: GET /api/lessons + JWT
Controller -> Controller: Validate query, sub and requested role
Controller -> Handler: Query with authenticated AccountId
Handler -> SQLServer: Count role-owned, filtered lessons
SQLServer --> Handler: totalCount
Handler -> SQLServer: Order by start + ID, Skip, Take
SQLServer --> Handler: Current page lessons only
Handler -> SQLServer: Active charges for page lesson IDs
SQLServer --> Handler: Actual paid/unpaid charges
Handler --> Screen: items, effective page, pageSize, totalCount
Screen --> User: Lesson cards, role actions and pagination
@enduml
